---
// StopOverpaying.astro - Stop Overpaying for Connectivity section
---

<section class="overpaying-section" id="stop-overpaying">
  <div class="overpaying-inner">
    <div class="overpaying-content">
      <h2 class="overpaying-title">Stop Overpaying for Connectivity</h2>
      <p class="overpaying-desc">
        Most businesses overpay for mobile, IoT, and roaming without knowing it. Spenza surfaces
        the waste with AI usage reports and telecom expense management, then helps you cut it.
        See your number in 60 seconds.
      </p>
      <a href="https://spenza.com/mvno-calculator/" class="btn btn-primary">Calculate now</a>
    </div>
    <div class="overpaying-visual">
      <img
        src="https://spenza.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/stop-overpaying-586x408-1-1.svg"
        alt="Stop overpaying for connectivity"
        loading="lazy"
        class="overpaying-img"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .overpaying-section {
    background: white;
    padding: 96px 2rem;
  }

  .overpaying-inner {
    max-width: 1140px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .overpaying-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #1a1a2e;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .overpaying-desc {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 14px 32px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: #FF4500;
    color: white;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: #e03d00;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(255, 69, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .overpaying-visual {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .overpaying-img {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 500px;
    height: auto;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .overpaying-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
    .overpaying-visual {
      order: -1;
    }
  }
</style>
